WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A customer calls. You're on the job.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
It goes to voicemail.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
By the time you call back, they've already booked someone else.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
With Speed-to-Lead, that missed call triggers an instant text-back.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
It lands in under thirty seconds.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The lead gets a reply, and the job lands in your CRM, automatically.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
No forms to fill in. No tabs to copy between.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Then a three-step follow-up runs on its own.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.000
And you get an alert the moment they reply.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.000
No leads lost to slow follow-up.
